<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 133 0 R/T(at the height of the COVID-19 pandemic, Minister Budi took office with an immediate mandate to bring the health crisis under control and accelerate Indonesia\220s vaccination programme. His response combined vaccine diplomacy and procurement, rapid expansion of vaccination capacity, strengthened surveillance and treatment, and close coordination across government, health workers, communities and international partners.)/E(at the height of the COVID-19 pandemic, Minister Budi took office with an immediate mandate to bring the health crisis under control and accelerate Indonesia\220s vaccination programme. His response combined vaccine diplomacy and procurement, rapid expansion of vaccination capacity, strengthened surveillance and treatment, and close coordination across government, health workers, communities and international partners.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

309 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 133 0 R/T(Under his leadership, Indonesia built one of the world\220s largest COVID-19 vaccination programmes. By June 2023, the country had administered more than 453 million vaccine doses. )/E(Under his leadership, Indonesia built one of the world\220s largest COVID-19 vaccination programmes. By June 2023, the country had administered more than 453 million vaccine doses. )/Pg 17 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

