<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 133 0 R/T(Indonesia secured vaccines through multiple channels, including bilateral procurement and the COVAX Facility, reducing reliance on a single supplier and helping protect a population spread across more than 7,000 inhabited islands. )/E(Indonesia secured vaccines through multiple channels, including bilateral procurement and the COVAX Facility, reducing reliance on a single supplier and helping protect a population spread across more than 7,000 inhabited islands. )/Pg 17 0 R/K[5]>>
