373 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 136 0 R/T(Leading the health sector in one of the world\220s  most disaster-prone countries, Minister Budi has established two immediate priorities in emergencies: saving lives and restoring critical health services as quickly as possible. )/E(Leading the health sector in one of the world\220s  most disaster-prone countries, Minister Budi has established two immediate priorities in emergencies: saving lives and restoring critical health services as quickly as possible. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

374 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 136 0 R/T(During the 2025 floods and landslides across Aceh, North Sumatra and West Sumatra, 87 hospitals and 867 primary healthcare centres were affected. Through coordinated deployment and rapid restoration efforts, all affected hospitals were brought back into operation within two weeks.)/E(During the 2025 floods and landslides across Aceh, North Sumatra and West Sumatra, 87 hospitals and 867 primary healthcare centres were affected. Through coordinated deployment and rapid restoration efforts, all affected hospitals were brought back into operation within two weeks.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

375 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 136 0 R/T(Following the 2026 East Nusa Tenggara earthquake, the Ministry activated Health Emergency Operation Centres, deployed Emergency Medical Teams and mobilised 392 health workers. Within just four days, two field hospitals were built and made operational, restoring emergency, surgical and other essential services while damaged facilities were being repaired. Minister Budi visited affected facilities in Nagekeo and Ruteng to oversee the response directly.)/E(Following the 2026 East Nusa Tenggara earthquake, the Ministry activated Health Emergency Operation Centres, deployed Emergency Medical Teams and mobilised 392 health workers. Within just four days, two field hospitals were built and made operational, restoring emergency, surgical and other essential services while damaged facilities were being repaired. Minister Budi visited affected facilities in Nagekeo and Ruteng to oversee the response directly.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

376 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 136 0 R/T(The same model guided the response to the 2022 Cianjur earthquake, when Health Emergency Operation Centres were activated within 12 hours, sustaining services across 22 hospitals, 19 primary healthcare centres and 300 health posts.)/E(The same model guided the response to the 2022 Cianjur earthquake, when Health Emergency Operation Centres were activated within 12 hours, sustaining services across 22 hospitals, 19 primary healthcare centres and 300 health posts.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[9]>>
