489 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 143 0 R/E(Under his leadership, Indonesia successfully navigated one of the most devastating pandemics in modern history. Building on the lessons of the COVID-19 pandemic, Indonesia has also actively contributed to advancing global health priorities, including through its membership of the WHO Executive Board from 2018 to 2021, its G20 Presidency in 2022, and its ASEAN Chairmanship in 2023. The establishment of the Pandemic Fund during Indonesia\220s G20 Presidency further demonstrates Indonesia\220s concrete commitment to strengthening the global health architecture. Throughout these efforts, Minister Budi Gunadi Sadikin has consistently championed stronger international cooperation and broader, more equitable access to essential health resources.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

