<</Title(Following the 2026 East Nusa Tenggara earthquake, the Ministry activated Health Emergency Operation Centres, deployed Emergency Medical Teams and mobilised 392 health workers. Within just four days, two field hospitals were built and made operational, restoring emergency, surgical and other essential services while damaged facilities were being repaired. Minister Budi visited affected facilities in Nagekeo and Ruteng to oversee the response directly.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1993 0 R/Prev 2004 0 R/Next 2005 0 R>>
