<</Title(Drawing on his experience in both banking and health, he outlined an integrated approach: modernising health legislation, investing in primary and referral care, expanding the health workforce, mobilising sustainable financing and shifting from treatment to prevention through nationwide screening. His leadership demonstrates how financial discipline and system transformation can turn UHC commitments into services that reach people.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2015 0 R/Prev 2029 0 R/Next 2020 0 R>>
