2025 0 obj
<</Title(As one of the Co-Chairs of the Accra Reset High-Level Panel, Minister Budi advocates shifting the global health architecture from fragmented, externally driven arrangements towards greater country agency, financing aligned behind national priorities and collective action where countries cannot act alone. Within this agenda, he champions country-led national health plans, sustainable domestic financing, stronger regional capacity and collective financing for global public goods.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2021 0 R/Next 2026 0 R>>
endobj

